  title: Aino
  snippet: "Age: 18\n\nAddress: 91 Willowbend Road\n\nLives with: Grandparents (Elina
    & Timo Lehtinen)\n\nNotes: Top grades in all subjects. Volunteers at a local
    animal shelter on weekends. No social media use. School suspects possible burnout
    \u2014 always stays after class.\n\nPhone: 555-281-9842"
  tags:
  - 'Information '
  metadataJson: 
